# Document tooling and spent scaffolding. This repository generates results; anything
# that reads or writes a .docx lives with the documents, under docs/tools/, and the
# one-shot revision scripts were archived on 11 Aug 2026 to codes/python/archive/.
# Both are already covered by the archive/ and docs/ rules above; named here so it is
# obvious the omission is deliberate rather than an oversight.
codes/python/archive/
codes/python/revision/
